 "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036703_576173451444056_2815308939854354726_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H-Be9SVkVesQ7kNvwE0Z58X&_nc_oc=Adqjmncc4zFwZtoj2JXr8zSnegVoHNwg3Pl74RzmREVIp1iKNn9wwf6Xjbj91I_bwos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5u-VZBC31VFYV7ZWqqvFQ0Lc0FjkWDQUGBjz892tFKOA&oe=6A0C70E8"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot D.png", "id": "480971648434463", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001662_480971655101129_6064421927720784354_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BYy3FkIrnOIQ7kNvwFAmDRK&_nc_oc=AdoR0KSHgXutnPkD6HBzPY-6bwkFaUZ7ACO1KHj3pq6RvJPn8Ssg3zu86IzCCv1gql8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6JO36cHhQbS_E-La_Q3yFpFPZ67s8tyoZh-suMtXa7qw&oe=6A0C6948"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot C.png", "id": "1683707145528823", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75508956_1683707148862156_8286553196679635241_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ogsCEcdgYHEQ7kNvwECtDzF&_nc_oc=AdrRabUHrf6JzY0_ydu8irvPTdEFRrSRBFxj3b6aXNVtd5Kkc1tbgWco1cj88jgbBpY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af71Bh_5FK1wfSuppLiGB99egqbrRhjo70gCO8wwJwembQ&oe=6A0C5ED4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cues Landscape v2.png", "id": "1206096493787337", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_1206096497120670_6286030136535771041_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mBFb7_6UCDcQ7kNvwFLCoNV&_nc_oc=AdorokkH-9LcTVh4CL_UB1TnQ8PYcXeN00VNePrHzgRPQw4SPShIAy8I1xL8VRNYKt4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7oN9z3Cy9Fukpz4lXnHO1oyU3LhGvlzfE0EfdGV3v_Sw&oe=6A0C87BB"}, "display_name": "Cues", "keywords": ["brick", "breaker", "mixed", "hand", "magic"], "long_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with **Cues**. Dive into a **hand-tracking** experience where music meets motion. \n\n**NEW:** Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\n- \u201cIt looks amazing. One of the coolest looking MR games I\u2019ve seen\u201d \u2013 Matt BMFVR\n\n{557242276938737}\n\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a **dynamically evolving symphony** influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises.\n\nIdeal for brief, engaging sessions, 'Cues' converts any room into a vibrant arena of musical puzzles.\n", "short_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with Cues. Dive into a hand-tracking experience where music meets motion. \n\nNEW: Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a dynamically evolving symphony influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises."}]}, "developer_name": "No Ragrets Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "publisher_name": "PotamWorks SAS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua